<title>JAPAN: Chiyoda weak on larger loss annoucement.</title>
<headline>Chiyoda weak on larger loss annoucement.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Chiyoda Corp weakened on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Thursday morning due to the company's announcement that it would post larger losses in the current business year than it originally throught.</p>
<p>At 0022 GMT, Chiyoda was down 20 yen at 509.</p>
